WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:21.600
Open the employee chat in InsightsIQ, iMBrace's staff chat.

2
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Start a conversation and choose the front door.

3
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:44.160
Select the Employee Front Door assistant.

4
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:53.440
An automated test enters an HR and IT question.

5
00:00:53.440 --> 00:02:01.480
The front door is preparing the specialist answers.

6
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:19.320
Completed tasks appear beside headed HR and IT answers.

7
00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:25.760
The HR answer keeps its policy citation under the specialist heading.

8
00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:33.320
Read the IT answer and its runbook reference.

9
00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:41.920
An automated test enters a sales and IT question in a new chat.

10
00:02:41.920 --> 00:03:39.200
The front door is preparing answers to the second question.

11
00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.200
The question brings together sales figures and an IT fix.

12
00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:58.200
Completed tasks appear beside the headed sales answer.

13
00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.700
Keep the sales answer and specialist task cards in view.

14
00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:11.700
Governance shows the assistant usage totals.

15
00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:29.700
Open AI Tracing and select the Employee Front Door.

16
00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:42.700
Explore the front door responses and latency.

17
00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:50.100
The tracing screen keeps agent activity in view.

18
00:04:50.100 --> 00:05:09.700
Open the Employee Front Door in AgentIQ, iMBrace's assistant builder.

19
00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:27.860
The front door has HR, IT and sales specialists linked.
